the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    the Zu versteuerndes Einkommen of *a case* is *a number*; scenario element.
    the Festzusetzende Einkommensteuer of *a case* is *a number*.
    Kredit wird gewährt holds for *a case*.
    the answer to Kredit wird gewährt for *a case* is *a truth value*; scenario element.
    Kredit wird gewährt would hold for *a case*; unknown.

the knowledge base r4_7_bindings includes:

the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/bindings.ruml".

the Festzusetzende Einkommensteuer of a case is a number N if
    the Zu versteuerndes Einkommen of the case is a number M
    and a thing T = M - 11604
    and N = T * 0.14.

Kredit wird gewährt holds for a case if
    the answer to Kredit wird gewährt for the case is true.

% Until a person answers, RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Kredit wird gewährt holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the answer to Kredit wird gewährt for the case is a truth value
    and Kredit wird gewährt would hold for the case.

scenario generated_1 is, as stated in "bindings.ruml" at generated_1:
    % every data point its first value
    the Zu versteuerndes Einkommen of case 1 is 0.
    node_1 expects answers ["Kredit wird gewährt holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_1 expects answers ["it is not the case that Kredit wird gewährt holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.

scenario generated_2 is, as stated in "bindings.ruml" at generated_2:
    % dp_zve has no value
    node_1 expects answers ["Kredit wird gewährt holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_1 expects answers ["it is not the case that Kredit wird gewährt holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.

scenario generated_3 is, as stated in "bindings.ruml" at generated_3:
    % dp_zve is 100
    the Zu versteuerndes Einkommen of case 1 is 100.
    node_1 expects answers ["Kredit wird gewährt holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_1 expects answers ["it is not the case that Kredit wird gewährt holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.

scenario generated_4 is, as stated in "bindings.ruml" at generated_4:
    % every leaf answered yes
    the Zu versteuerndes Einkommen of case 1 is 0.
    the answer to Kredit wird gewährt for case 1 is true.
    node_1 expects answers ["Kredit wird gewährt holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_1 expects answers [].

scenario generated_5 is, as stated in "bindings.ruml" at generated_5:
    % the leaf 1 answered no, the others yes
    the Zu versteuerndes Einkommen of case 1 is 0.
    the answer to Kredit wird gewährt for case 1 is false.
    node_1 expects answers [].
    not_node_1 expects answers ["it is not the case that Kredit wird gewährt holds for case 1"].

query node_1 is:
    Kredit wird gewährt holds for case 1.

query not_node_1 is:
    it is not the case that Kredit wird gewährt holds for case 1.

